docs {
  # Admin Update Funding Settings

  Admin uses this endpoint to switch the one-time funding provider or set the wallet funding charge for one provider.

  Use it for:

  - `pocketfi` permanent virtual-account funding
  - `monnify` one-time funding account
  - `maplerad` one-time funding account
  - `flutterwave` one-time funding account

  ## Endpoint

  `PATCH /api/v1/admin/funding/settings`

  ## Authentication

  Admin JWT required.

  ```txt
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
  ```

  ## Body Fields

  `oneTimeFundingProvider`
  Optional. Use `flutterwave`, `maplerad`, or `monnify` to switch the provider used by `POST /api/v1/wallet/funding-intents`.

  `provider`
  Required when updating fees. Use `pocketfi`, `monnify`, `maplerad`, or `flutterwave`.

  `percent`
  Optional. Percentage funding charge. Use `1` for 1%.

  `flat`
  Optional. Flat naira charge. Use `0` when no flat charge is needed.

  `cap`
  Optional. Maximum fee in naira. Use `500` to cap the charge at N500. Use `0` for no cap.

  `creditPolicy`
  Optional. Only `gross` is accepted because BillXpress pays pay-in fees and users receive their full transfer.

  ## Example Body

  ```json
  {
    "oneTimeFundingProvider": "flutterwave"
  }
  ```

  To update PocketFi fees:

  ```json
  {
    "provider": "pocketfi",
    "percent": 1,
    "flat": 0
  }
  ```

  To update Monnify instead:

  ```json
  {
    "provider": "monnify",
    "percent": 1,
    "flat": 0
  }
  ```

  To update Maplerad fees:

  ```json
  {
    "provider": "maplerad",
    "percent": 0.5,
    "flat": 0,
    "cap": 500,
    "creditPolicy": "gross"
  }
  ```

  To update Flutterwave fees:

  ```json
  {
    "provider": "flutterwave",
    "percent": 1,
    "flat": 0,
    "cap": 0,
    "creditPolicy": "gross"
  }
  ```

  ## Expected Response

  ```json
  {
    "message": "One-time funding provider updated successfully",
    "providerSettings": {
      "oneTimeFundingProvider": "flutterwave"
    }
  }
  ```

  Fee update response:

  ```json
  {
    "message": "Funding fee setting updated successfully",
    "setting": {
      "provider": "pocketfi",
      "percent": 1,
      "flat": 0,
      "cap": 0,
      "creditPolicy": "gross",
      "paidBy": "platform",
      "userReceivesFullAmount": true,
      "message": "Funding charge is 1%. The user wallet is credited with the full transferred amount."
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Credit Policy

  Keep Maplerad pay-in on `creditPolicy: "gross"` so the platform pays the provider fee and the full incoming transfer is credited. Payout fees are configured separately under `/api/v1/admin/transfers/settings`.

  The user app does not call this endpoint. Only the admin dashboard should call it.
}
